// expect-result: {"a":2,"b":7,"c":8}
// 000-intro.md: contextual identifier and keyword parsing follow the source context
// rule: docs/design/src/000-intro.md#137f3cf006a1053a
// 000-intro.md: fork is an ordinary plain-code binding and a keyword in effect code
// rule: docs/design/src/000-intro.md#c6445bfbbb5f951d
